.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
sysimage.so
# Simulation output — task dirs run to ~200 GB on HPC and figures are
# regenerated per-arm by analysis_p6.R. Nothing under outputs/ is tracked;
# figures the chapter compiles against are curated into figures/ deliberately.
outputs/

# Legacy artifacts of the retired sweep.slurm path, still present on HPC.
# The current pipeline writes params to outputs/<tag>/params.txt and sends
# SLURM logs to /scratch/%u/, so neither of these is regenerated.
logs/
/params.txt

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# R packages for the analysis stage, installed by scripts/bootstrap_r_libs.sh.
# Compiled objects, ~200 MB, and specific to hopper R version + toolchain.
.Rlib/

# LaTeX byproducts of the superseded Sweave draft (draft/draft.Rnw). The three
# sources — draft.Rnw, draft.tex, draft.pdf — are tracked; everything below is
# regenerable and was only ever tracked by accident. Added 2026-08-19 with the
# draft/ move.
draft/draft.bbl
draft/draft.log
draft/draft.maf
draft/draft.mtc
draft/draft.mtc0
draft/draft.synctex.gz
draft/draft-concordance.tex

# Stale console dumps from pre-pipeline interactive runs, untracked 2026-08-19.
# 1.out was 15 MB / 73,900 lines and nothing referenced it. Real job output goes
# to logs/ (already ignored) via the .slurm files.
*.out
*.err
out.txt
.DS_Store
